MODULE: RearmRefreshesReArmNoJitter
TARGET: RearmRefreshes
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: terminal rearm reuses the old phase without requesting a new offset
PERTURBS: ReArm

--- FIND
            ![l].refreshed = TRUE, ![l].round = @ + 1,
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: skip the phase refresh, not an invented randomness-fairness promise.
            ![l].refreshed = FALSE, ![l].round = @ + 1,
--- END
